      "limits": "Initial entitlement/recipient/House fixture rows use privileged seed paths. Not the whole House/Store fixture graph and not the real desktop client.",
      "disposition": "KEEP_DISTINCT_WIRE_AND_DURABLE_CONTINUATION_ORACLES"
    }
